# Implementation Plan — Model 4: Consolidated Central VMS Platform

Develop and integrate **Model 4 (Consolidated Central Video Management System)** into the Sentinel Gujarat CCTV Platform (`Model-1`). This implementation delivers a production-grade, state-scale VMS capable of centralised multi-department feed ingestion, multi-task AI analytics (ANPR, Face Recognition, Crowd Density, Anomaly Detection), statewide vehicle route reconstruction, authorised government database integrations (VAHAN, SARTHI, eGujCop, AFIS/NAFIS, CCTNS), tiered storage (Hot, Warm, Cold with Ceph/S3), 80,000 camera scalability & load testing, disaster recovery (SDC & DRS), and zero-trust security architecture.

