>   4. **Anomaly & Threat Detection**: Unattended baggage, perimeter tripwire breach, wrong-way driving, overcrowding hazards.
> - **80,000 Camera Scalability Lab**: An interactive load-testing lab is included with synthetic stress generators simulating up to 80,000 camera streams, calculating 160 Gbps aggregate bandwidth, GPU node dimensioning, Kafka partitioning, and Kubernetes deployment manifests.

