## Proposed Changes

### 1. Backend: Python FastAPI Microservice (`services/analytics-service`)

#### [NEW] [`vms_model4_db.py`](file:///c:/Users/dassh/Project/Model-1/services/analytics-service/vms_model4_db.py)
- SQLite database schema and persistence layer for Model 4:
  - `vms_recordings`: Video chunk metadata, hot/warm/cold storage tier, PTS timestamps, bookmarks.
  - `vms_face_detections`: Biometric face sightings, embeddings, AFIS/NAFIS match scores, criminal profile linkages.
  - `vms_crowd_metrics`: Density percent, pedestrian count, vehicle rate per camera and timestamp.
  - `vms_anomalies`: Anomaly type (TRIPWIRE, WRONG_WAY, UNATTENDED_BAG, OVERCROWDING), bounding box, severity, status.
  - `vms_vahan_records`: National vehicle registration database records (owner, RC status, chassis, engine, fitness).
  - `vms_sarthi_records`: National driving license database records (DL status, holder info, validity, classes).
  - `vms_egujcop_records`: Gujarat Police FIR and stolen vehicle records.
  - `vms_nafis_records`: National automated fingerprint/biometric identification records.
  - `vms_dr_logs`: Disaster recovery failover drill execution logs.
  - `vms_audit_trail`: Tamper-proof evidentiary export and user action logs.

#### [NEW] [`ai_multitask_engine.py`](file:///c:/Users/dassh/Project/Model-1/services/analytics-service/ai_multitask_engine.py)
- Multi-task Computer Vision engine supporting:
  - ANPR with YOLOv8 & OCR with PTS-driven monotonic speed calculation.
  - Face Recognition embedding extractor and distance metric matching against AFIS/NAFIS.
  - Crowd density & pedestrian footfall counter with heatmap matrix generation.
  - Spatial-temporal anomaly detector (tripwire intrusion, wrong-way driving, abandoned luggage).

#### [NEW] [`load_test_engine.py`](file:///c:/Users/dassh/Project/Model-1/services/analytics-service/load_test_engine.py)
- Real-time synthetic load testing engine simulating 10,000 to 80,000 concurrent cameras:
  - Computes throughput (Gbps), packet loss (<0.01%), latency percentiles (p50, p95, p99), Kafka queue lag, GPU/CPU utilization %.
  - Generates downloadable compliance benchmark reports.

#### [NEW] [`vms_model4_router.py`](file:///c:/Users/dassh/Project/Model-1/services/analytics-service/vms_model4_router.py)
- RESTful API router exposing all Model 4 endpoints under `/api/vms/*`:
  - `/api/vms/overview`: State-wide KPIs, ingestion health, storage tier distribution, active AI alarms.
  - `/api/vms/cameras`: Multi-department camera catalogue with RTSP, HLS proxy, WebRTC URLs.
  - `/api/vms/playback/{cam_id}`: Time-indexed video chunks, bookmarks, timeline scrubber metadata.
  - `/api/vms/storage/metrics` & `/api/vms/storage/calculate`: Tiered storage stats, Ceph/S3 browser, 80k sizing calculator.
  - `/api/vms/ai/anpr`, `/api/vms/ai/face-recognition`, `/api/vms/ai/crowd-density`, `/api/vms/ai/anomalies`: Multi-task AI feeds.
  - `/api/vms/integrations/vahan`, `/api/vms/integrations/sarthi`, `/api/vms/integrations/egujcop`, `/api/vms/integrations/nafis`: Government DB query & sync endpoints.
  - `/api/vms/scalability/80k-model` & `/api/vms/scalability/load-test`: Scalability architecture and live load test generator.
  - `/api/vms/dr/status` & `/api/vms/dr/failover-drill`: SDC/DRS dual-datacenter replication & failover simulator.
  - `/api/vms/security/audit`: RBAC matrix, encryption telemetry, tamper-proof video export chain of custody.

